    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Marina gha Wakohani na Walawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha nigho marina gha wakohani na Walawi werewurieghe kufuma wubarishonyi na Zerubabeli na mwana wa Shealtieli, na Mkohani M'baa Jeshua: Seraia, na Jeremia, na Ezra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaria, Maluki, na Hatushi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekami, Rehumu, Meremothi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido, Ginethoni, Abija, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mijamini, Moadia, Biliza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shemaia, Joiaribu, Jedaia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salu, Amoku, Hilkia, na Jedaia. Awa werekoghe wakohani wabaa, na wabaa wa waruna ngelo ya Mkohani M'baa Jeshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi ni awa: Jeshua, Binui, Kadmieli, Sherebia, Juda, na wokoni Matania; uo chiaimweri na waruna, werekoghe wazighaniri wa chumbo refunya chwawucha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakbukia na Uni chiaimweri na waruna, werekaieghe kimusi kulangayana nawo ngelo ya wutasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Mkohani M'baa Jeshua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeshua orekoghe ndee wa Joiakimu, na Joiakimu orekoghe ndee wa Eliashibu, na Eliashibu orekoghe ndee wa Joiada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Joiada orekoghe wa Jonathani, na Jonathani orekoghe ndee wa Jaddua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vilongozi va kichuku cha Wukohani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo ra Mkohani M'baa Joiakimu, wakohani werekoghe wabaa wa vichuku vawo ni awa: mkohani wa kichuku cha Seraia, ni Meraia; wa kichuku cha Jeremia, ni Hanania; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Ezra, ni Meshulamu; wa kichuku cha Amaria, ni Jehohanani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Maluki, ni Jonathani; wa kichuku cha Shekani, ni Josefu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Harimu, ni Adna; wa kichuku cha Meremothi ni Helkai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Ido, ni Zekaria; wa kichuku cha Ginethoni, ni Meshulamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Abija, ni Zikri; wa kichuku cha Miniamini, na cha Moadia, ni Piltai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Bilga, ni Shamua; wa kichuku cha Shemaia ni Jehonathani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Joiaribu, ni Matenai; wa kichuku cha Jedaia, ni Uzi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Salu, ni Kalai; wa kichuku cha Amoku, ni Eberi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kichuku cha Hilkia, ni Hashabia; wa kichuku cha Jedaia, ni Nethaneli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vinyumba va wakohani na Walawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku gha Wakohani Wabaa Eliashibu, Joiada, Johanani, na Jadua vinyumba va Walawi na wakohani vereandikiloghe na kumerelwa ngelo Mzuri Dario orekoghe ukibonya nguma Pashia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaa wa vichuku va Lawi, vereandikiloghe andenyi ya Chuo cha Malagho gha Ngelo hata matuku gha Johanani mwana wa Eliashibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwagha kazi Hekalunyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunughana na wulongozi ghwa Hashabia, Sherebia, na Jeshua mwana wa Kadmieli, Walawi werewaghiloghe waruna mafungu awi, wimkaseghe na kumfunyiragha chawucha Mlungu kwa mazughe sa iji koni werelaghiriloghe ni Daudi uo mundu wa Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matania, Bakbukia, Obadia, Meshulamu, Talmoni, na Akubu werekoghe walindiri wa mbenge wikilindia nyumba ra stoo mbengenyi ra Hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu awa werekaieghe matuku gha Mkohani M'baa Joiakimu mwana wa Jeshua wawae Jehosadaki, na Nehemia m'baa wa isanga, na Ezra mkohani na mwalimu wa Sharia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia kughuwika wurigha ghwa muzi wakfu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo ya kughuwika wurigha ghwa muzi ghwa Jerusalemu wakfu, werewilolieghe na kuwireda Walawi Jerusalemu kufuma andu kose werekoghe wikikaia wichebonya ndima ewika wurigha wakfu kwa kuboilwa, na kufunya chawucha, na kubora kwa kayamba, na kinubi, na zeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabori wikakwana kufuma mbai-mbai ya Jerusalemu, na kufuma mbai mbai ya mizi mitini Netofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kufuma Beth-gilgali, na chia ra geba na Azmawethi, angu wabori wereaghieghe mizi mitini-mitini mbai mbai ya Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakohani na Walawi wikakuelesha weni, na kuwielesha wandu, na mbenge ra wurigha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngavikwanya vilongozi va Juda aighu wurighenyi, ngavibonya wikaie wazighaniri wa mafungu awi mabaa gha wandu, wimareghe aighu ya wurigha wikimfunyira Mlungu chawucha. Ifungu ja imbiri jikaghenda mkonu ghwa kiwomi aighu ya wurigha ichia cha Mbenge ya Wuchafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikanughwa ni Hoshaia na nusu ya vilongozi va Juda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Azaria, Ezra, Meshulamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda, Benjamini, Shemaia na Jeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiaimweri na wakohani wamu wiko na tarumbeta; na wokoni Zekaria mwana wa Jonathani, wawae Shemaia mwana wa Metania, na Mika, na Zakuri, na Asafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikanughwa ni wamzawo wamu, Shemaia, Azareli, Milalia, Gilalai, Maai, Nethaneli, Juda, na Hanani; wose wiko na vombo vebora sa va Daudi mundu wa Mlungu. Ezra uo mwalimu wa Shraia ukawilongoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiendavika Mbenge ya Ndoria, wikajoka na viluwatiro vejoka cha muzi ghwa Daudi; wikaida ngome ya Daudi na kuwuya cha Mbenge ya Machi iichia cha mashariki ya muzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifungu ja kawi ja wandu werekoghe wikifunya chawucha jereghendieghe chia ya mkonu ghwa kiwaka aighu wurighenyi; nani ngawinugha na nusu ya wandu. Dikaghenda na kuida Mnara ghwa Mariko hata Wurigha Mshapa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kufuma aho, dikaida Mbenge ya Efraimu, na Mbenge ya Kala, na Mbenge ya Samaki, na Mnara ghwa Hananeli na Mnara ghwa Ighana hata Mbenge ya Ng'ondi; nawo wikacha na kukaia kimusi aho Mbenge ingiagha Hekalunyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo mafungu ghose gha awo werekoghe wikifunya chawucha wikakaia kimusi Hekalunyi chiaimweri nani na nusu ya wabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifungu japo jerekoghe na wakohani awa: Eliakimu, Maaseia, Miniamini, Mikaia na Elibenai, Zekaria na Shemaia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni Maaseia, Shemaia, Eleazari, Uzi, Jehohanani, Malkija, Elamu, na Ezeri. Wabori wikabora wikilongozwa ni Jezrahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ijo wandu wikafunya vizongona vingi kwa kuboilwa kubaa, ungi Mlungu orewinekieghe kuboilwa kubaa. Waka na wanake wori wereboiloghe. Ndoghoi ya maboilo agho ikasikirika kula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mafunyo kwa wundu ghwa wutasi Hekalunyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, wandu werewikiloghe wikaie wazighaniri wa stoo; andu mafunyo kwa wundu ghwa Hekalu gherewikwagha, chiaimweri na ifungu ja ikumi, na mavalo gha imbiri gha viro na matunda ghiwurue gha kula mwaka. Wandu awo niwo werewikiloghe wewada vilambo kufuma mbuwenyi riko kaavui na mizi kwa wundu ghwa wakohani na Walawi sa iji sharia ighoragha. Wandu wose wa Juda wereboiloghe ni wakohani na Walawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu werebonyagha wutasi ghwa kukuelesha na mizango mizima erewikiloghe ni Mlungu. Wabori wa Hekalunyi na Walindiri wa Hekalu wikabonya agho gherelaghiriloghe ni Daudi na mwana wake Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
